  <text>
    <body>
      <p source="#source-408-449"><seg source="#source-408-449">黄菊はすでに散つてしまつた</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-449-460"><seg source="#source-449-460">漕手よ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-460-498"><seg source="#source-460-498">船路を遠くかへつてくる時</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-498-578"><seg source="#source-498-519">さびしい海鳥は</seg><hi rend="bouten 傍点 right" source="#source-519-561" corresp="#source-528-561"><seg source="#source-519-528">ますと</seg></hi><seg source="#source-561-578">に飛びかひ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-578-616"><seg source="#source-578-616">日は憂鬱の浪にただよふ。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-616-627"><seg source="#source-616-627">漕手よ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-627-689"><seg source="#source-627-651">はや君の家の窓に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-651-672"><rb>燈火</rb><rt>あかり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-672-689">はつけられ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-689-724"><seg source="#source-689-724">妹はひとり庭にたたずむ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-724-751"><seg source="#source-724-751">漕手よ、祈祷せよ。</seg></p>
    </body>
